  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Publish Whar You pay</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity building of oversight actors in Iraq, Kenya, and Lebanon aiming at  addreing high levels of opacity and corruption in the oil sector by supporting coalition and capacity building among oversight actors, civil society organisations, impacted communities, journalists &amp; academics; and supporting policy advocacy efforts including in relation to contract transparency, community consultations, and revenue disclosure and management.</narrative>
  </description>
